+ * chopgimp-shapetool.c — ChopGimp: Photoshop-like Shape tool (U)
+ *
+ * Drag on the canvas to draw a rectangle, rounded rectangle, ellipse,
+ * polygon, star or line. Shift constrains (square, circle, 45° line), Alt
+ * draws from the center. On release, the shape becomes a vector layer with
+ * the fill and stroke chosen in the options bar (same options as the path
+ * tool: fill/stroke enable, color or pattern, width, opacity, dashes).
